  <TEXT><TIMEX3 tid="t1" type="DATE" value="PRESENT_REF" temporalFunction="true">GAUR EGUNEKO</TIMEX3> <EVENT eid="e1" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">GAIXOTASUNA</EVENT>&#13;
65 urteko gizonezkoa, anbulantzian <EVENT eid="e2" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ekarri</EVENT> dute <TIMEX3 tid="t2" type="DURATION" value="PT15H" temporalFunction="false">15 orduko</TIMEX3> <EVENT eid="e3" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">bilakaera</EVENT> daukan abdomeneko <EVENT eid="e4" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">mina</EVENT> dela-eta.&#13;
&#13;
LARRIALDIETARA <EVENT eid="e5" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">HELTZEAN</EVENT>&#13;
<EVENT eid="e6" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">TA</EVENT> 107/61; <EVENT eid="e7" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">BM</EVENT> (<EVENT eid="e8" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">bihotz-maiztasuna</EVENT>) 107 taupada/min; O2 <EVENT eid="e9" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">saturazioa</EVENT> %94, 2 l/min O2 <EVENT eid="e10" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">sudur-betaurrekoekin</EVENT>; espazio eta denbora aldetik <EVENT eid="e11" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">kontziente</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e12" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">orientaturik</EVENT>; <EVENT eid="e13" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">zurbiltasun</EVENT> mukokutaneoa. Abdomeneko <EVENT eid="e14" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">min</EVENT> orokorra <EVENT eid="e15" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">haztatzean</EVENT>.&#13;
&#13;
EMERGENTZIA kodea: <EVENT eid="e16" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">HEMORRAGIA</EVENT> MASIBO SUSMOA!!!&#13;
&#13;
<EVENT eid="e17" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">AURREKARI</EVENT> PERTSONALAK&#13;
Medikamentuekiko <EVENT eid="e18" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">alergia</EVENT> ezagunik ez. &#13;
1 pakete/eguneko <EVENT eid="e19" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">erretzailea</EVENT>. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e20" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">HTA</EVENT> ez, <EVENT eid="e21" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">DM</EVENT> ez. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e22" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Dislipemia</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e23" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">tratamendu</EVENT> medikopean. &#13;
Ez <EVENT eid="e24" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">bronkopata</EVENT>, ez <EVENT eid="e25" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">kardiopata</EVENT>, ez <EVENT eid="e26" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">gastrohepatiopata</EVENT> itxuraz. &#13;
Ez <EVENT eid="e27" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">IK</EVENT>. &#13;
Ohiko medikazioa: <EVENT eid="e28" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Ansium</EVENT> behar du&#13;
&#13;
<EVENT eid="e29" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">PROBA</EVENT> OSAGARRIAK&#13;
<EVENT eid="e30" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">EKG</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e31" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">erritmikoa</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e32" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">sinusala</EVENT> 100 lpm, birpolarizazioaren <EVENT eid="e33" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">alterazio</EVENT> akuturik gabe.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e34" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">BIOKIMICA</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e35" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">HEMOGRAMA</EVENT> ETA <EVENT eid="e36" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">HEMOSTASIA</EVENT>&#13;
